    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game play.</h2>This is a single player FPS game. Starting in the 2170s, there are two tribes in total. The main character is a human being.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Information</h2>It is still in the early stages of development and there is making games with TENGINE.<br><br>Through future updates, we will make a difference in the overall game through multiplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer</h2>Multiplayer is generally a mode system, and multiplayer has two servers, Vanilla and Mode (plugin), and you create your own. The user who creates the server can freely make various changes through the API, and although it may be difficult, they will try various changes such as maps, interface changes, weapons changes, and mini games.",
